<mxfile host="dsh" agent="draw-a-skill-flow.py"><diagram id="manage-vk" name="manage-vk"><mxGraphModel dx="0" dy="0" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1582" pageHeight="1670" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="head" value="manage-vk" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="60" width="640" height="78" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="s0" value="&lt;b&gt;The order to think in: boundaries, functions, meaning, requests&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#444444&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;A request is the last thing to think about, not the first.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#999999&quot; style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;The order to think in: boundaries, functions, meaning, requests&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="180" width="640" height="88" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a0" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="head" target="s0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="s1" value="&lt;b&gt;Step 0 — the preflight, and it must pass before anything else&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#444444&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;bash
python scripts/preflight.py


It is read-only by construction.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#999999&quot; style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;Step 0 — the preflight, and it must pass before anything else&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="310" width="640" height="88" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a1" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s0" target="s1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="s2" value="&lt;b&gt;Step 1 — the token lives in the environment, and nowhere else&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#444444&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;bash
VK_COMMUNITY_TOKEN=&lt;the community key      a user environment variable, not a file
VK_GROUP_ID=123456789                       the community&#x27;s nu&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#999999&quot; style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;Step 1 — the token lives in the environment, and nowhere else&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="440" width="640" height="88" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a2" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s1" target="s2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="s3" value="&lt;b&gt;Step 2 — what a community token can and cannot do, measured&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#444444&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;A community token can write and cannot read, and it can write and cannot undo.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#999999&quot; style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;Step 2 — what a community token can and cannot do, measured&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="570" width="640" height="88" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a3" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s2" target="s3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="s4" value="&lt;b&gt;Step 3 — the confirmation gate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#444444&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Before the first write, all of the following are printed and the run stops until the
human answers:


target      the community, by name and by id, as&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#999999&quot; style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;Step 3 — the confirmation gate&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="700" width="640" height="88" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a4" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s3" target="s4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="s5" value="&lt;b&gt;Step 4 — publish, or schedule&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#444444&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;bash
python scripts/post.py --env-file &quot;$DSH_HOME/vk.env&quot; --target 123456789 --file draft.txt
python scripts/post.py ...&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#999999&quot; style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;Step 4 — publish, or schedule&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="830" width="640" height="88" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a5" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s4" target="s5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="s6" value="&lt;b&gt;Photos: the upload works, the attachment is dropped, and that is not obvious&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#444444&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Measured, and the first version of this skill got it wrong in a way worth recording.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#999999&quot; style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;Photos: the upload works, the attachment is dropped, and that is not obvious&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="960" width="640" height="88" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a6" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s5" target="s6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="s7" value="&lt;b&gt;The four-step photo sequence, for a credential that has a wall upload server&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#444444&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#999999&quot; style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;The four-step photo sequence, for a credential that has a wall upload server&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="1090" width="640" height="88" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a7" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s6" target="s7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="s8" value="&lt;b&gt;Errors do not arrive as HTTP errors&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#444444&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Measured, without a token:


GET https://api.vk.com/method/groups.getById?group_id=123456789&amp;v=5.199
- HTTP 200
   {&quot;error&quot;:{&quot;error_code&quot;:15,&quot;error_ms&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#999999&quot; style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;Errors do not arrive as HTTP errors&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="1220" width="640" height="88" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a8" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s7" target="s8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="s9" value="&lt;b&gt;The rate ceiling&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#444444&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;VK allows a small number of requests per second per token, and the ceiling is not the same
for every method.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#999999&quot; style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;The rate ceiling&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="1350" width="640" height="88" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a9" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s8" target="s9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="s10" value="&lt;b&gt;Russian text, before it is pasted anywhere&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#444444&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;bash
python scripts/typo_lint.py article.md             report
python scripts/typo_lint.py article.md --fix       rewrite in place


Nine rules, of wh&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#999999&quot; style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;Russian text, before it is pasted anywhere&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="1480" width="640" height="88" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a10" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s9" target="s10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="<b>ЧТО ЭТО ЗА СХЕМА</b><br>Порядок работы скилла manage-vk: шаги в том порядке, в каком их надо делать.<br>Это НЕ структура файлов (family.drawio) и НЕ ворота регламента (gates.drawio).<br>&nbsp;<br><b>КАК ЧИТАТЬ</b><br>Синяя рамка сверху — сам скилл. Стрелка вниз — следующий шаг.<br>Заголовок по-русски, под ним зачем этот шаг, внизу мелко — исходный заголовок.<br>&nbsp;<br><b>О ЧЁМ ЭТОТ СКИЛЛ</b><br>&nbsp;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B3B3B3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=10;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="832" y="60" width="660" height="226" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>